{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_06BFE0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Peace Walker搭载了好几种近距离战斗武器。毕竟它还有一路走进敌境后自爆的计划。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"真够给人添麻烦的。都有什么武装？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"首先是把靠近它的一切烧掉的火焰喷射器。后方也有喷口，要小心。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"还有S地雷。那东西类似集束炸弹，会从腿部舱口释放后四散开来。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":88,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"一看到舱口打开就赶紧躲开。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":39,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"最后是火箭弹。射程很远，必须小心。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"反过来，火箭弹打不了太近的目标，不过靠得太近又有火焰喷射器……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"而且对步兵时，腿本身也能当武器，可以直接用腿攻击。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"真麻烦……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":15,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"不过，Peace Walker还没完成。只有Reptile Pod时，它只能做简单动作，而且行动有明显的规律。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":119,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"只要仔细观察它攻击前的动作，应该就能判断下一步会做什么。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""}]}